# Barks (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Barks"): one line to a player passing within 6 m, without Talk. One a
# minute per player, one per speaker per player every 10 minutes. A bark never names a player who
# is in someone else's kit, never jokes about who eats, and never gives away anything the player
# couldn't see. `once` barks are said once a life per speaker.

conv bark.occupant.short
for occupant
when house:short & !house:died
bark
voice haven

node start
  say? promise:house.tins@here :: "Tins? No? Later, then. We're good at later."
  say? kept:house.tins@here :: "You're the one who brought the tins. The children call you the tin one. It's a compliment."
  say "Mind the stores. We're counting."

conv bark.occupant.died
for occupant
when house:died
bark
voice haven

node start
  say "Hat off, if you're coming in. We lost someone."

conv bark.occupant.dusk
for occupant
when dusk & !house:died
bark
voice haven

node start
  say "Light's going. In or out, love. Not on the step."

conv bark.named.redhand.crew
for named:redhand
when crew & !kit:in_kit & !hunted:redhand
bark
voice redhand

node start
  say? tier:redhand>=trusted :: "Oi, {crew}! Still breathing? The book's thrilled."
  say "Oi, {crew}! Don't go far. You owe us a story."

conv bark.named.redhand.toll
for named:redhand/toll_man
when !crew & !hunted:redhand
bark
voice redhand

node start
  say "Toll's {toll}. Don't make me say it twice. I charge for twice."

conv bark.named.bastion.shift
for named:bastion
when hour>=17 & hour<18 & !hunted:bastion
bark
voice bastion

node start
  say "Shift change at half five. Two minutes. Don't stand there."

conv bark.named.bastion.word
for named:bastion
when setword:bastion & !kit:in_kit & !hunted:bastion
bark
once
voice bastion

node start
  say "{word}. As you were."

conv bark.named.halcyon.rota
for named:halcyon
when !kit:in_kit & !hunted:halcyon
bark
voice halcyon

node start
  say? night :: "Lights out at the lab is a suggestion. Nobody follows it. Nobody sleeps."
  say "Mind the samples. They're labelled. You aren't."

conv bark.wanderer.kid
for wanderer:kid
when kidlost
bark
voice plain

node start
  say "Are you going to the house? Can I come? I won't talk. Much."

conv bark.wanderer.scavenger.back
for wanderer:scavenger
when due:scav.came_back & !nmem:honest
bark
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Oh. You. How was the chemist's? Don't answer. Your face says it all."

conv bark.named.bastion.back
for named:bastion/sentry
when kept:sentry.road@here.visit
bark
once
voice bastion

node start
  say "Road's logged as walked. Your name's on it. In pencil, but it's on it."
